# S6-02 / S7-B6: .dockerignore for the lilIAn monorepo.
# This trims the Docker build context dramatically (saves minutes per
# build) and prevents secrets / build artefacts from leaking into the
# image.
#
# Keep this in sync with `.gitignore` for secrets, caches, and build
# artefacts. Anything that should not be in a published image belongs
# here.

# VCS, IDE, local tooling
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.vercel
.claude
.agents
.claude-flow
.code-review-graph
.vscode
.idea

# Local secrets — MUST never enter the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example

# Python caches and virtualenvs
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/venv
**/.venv
**/env
**/.env
**/.Python
**/*.egg
**/*.egg-info
**/.eggs

# Node / Next.js
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/.turbo
**/.parcel-cache
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnp.*

# Tests and coverage
**/tests
!**/apps/backend/tests
**/coverage
**/htmlcov
**/.nyc_output
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.tox
**/.nox

# Docs / media / scripts / Dockerfiles
docs
images
**/*.md
!apps/backend/README.md
scripts
**/Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile.*
**/docker-compose.yml
**/docker-compose.*.yml

# Build / CI artefacts
**/.vite
**/dist
**/build
**/.cache
**/.tsbuildinfo

# App-specific uploads
**/laws/*.pdf
**/storage
**/uploads
**/test_uploads
**/tmp
**/temp

# Logs and OS noise
**/*.log
**/logs
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db